5,1,1,talk,Yumi,,Hello everyone! I'm so excited to help out! I'll look into the winter road closures north of the river and the bus links in the two outer wards to see how people get around.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,I shall examine the two programmes begun six years ago and the attendance sheets from former outreach stops. It would be a pity to repeat old mistakes simply because we forgot we made them.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Shion,,"I'll check the volunteer register and supervision training, as well as the neighbourhood associations and tool certification. It's important to know if we actually have the competence to manage new initiatives.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Minako,,"I will examine the county grant terms and the endowment, as well as the running and equipment lines from last year. I want to understand the long-term stability of our funding.","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,"I... I think I'll look into the evening room bookings and remote catalogue use, and also the bus links in the two outer wards. I just want to see who can actually get to us.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
